      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These groups typically build their ideology around a concept of inherent racial hierarchy, claiming that certain races are naturally superior to others. They heavily rely on narratives of cultural purity and the perceived threat of \"replacement\" or demographic change. Their rhetoric often frames society as a zero-sum struggle where the survival of their perceived in-group is pitted against the perceived threat of out-groups. This internal logic justifies extreme measures by portraying their worldview as a necessary defense against existential danger.",
