      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "They frequently misuse outdated or fabricated concepts from early 20th-century eugenics to lend a veneer of scientific legitimacy to their claims. They often cherry-pick or completely invent data to suggest inherent, immutable biological differences in intelligence, temperament, or moral capacity between racial groups. By co-opting the language of biology and genetics, they attempt to transform subjective prejudice into an objective, \"natural law.\" This pseudo-scientific framing is crucial for making their discriminatory beliefs seem like undeniable facts rather than mere opinions.",
      "source": "target",
